{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209220","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320922001:0":{"text":"ロンロンがくまなく探しましたが、シェニアさんの墓石はやっぱり三つでした。","source_cn":"满满找过了，墓园里只有三座克谢尼娅的墓碑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8405219F730CE8E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320922002:0":{"text":"見てください！この「勇敢な息子さんと再会できますように」と記載された墓石に違いありません！","source_cn":"看起来，这块写着“愿你与你英勇的儿子团聚”的墓碑应该就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69462B776476188","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320922003:0":{"text":"それにしても、墓石の老朽化が激しいですね。この分だと棺桶も腐敗してる可能性が高そうです。新しいものを探しましょう。","source_cn":"不过，这块墓碑很残破，墓地上方的泥土也塌陷了，棺材很可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF51472281F1830E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320922004:0":{"text":"墓地なら使われてない棺桶もあるはずだよ！<style=\"highlight\">墓守のおじさん</style>に聞いてみよう！","source_cn":"墓园里应该有没用过的棺材！我们去<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3782E08936A8EBE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑙姆":{"text":"ナウム","source":"瑙姆","status":"matched_dial